    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i just wasted 20 years of my life. everything i built, the company, the house, the whole thing is just... gone. i poured everything into it and now there is literally nothing left. i feel like i'm just running on empty and there's no point in even trying to rebuild. what was even the point of all that effort if it just ends up like this?",
